{"unit_id":"mervyn-teo__dsh-plugin-terminal#card-zh","repo":"mervyn-teo/dsh-plugin-terminal","commit":"b542655664c236a7d28582d79c5a5f0e5258318c","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Terminal（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：在 DSH Web 页脚提供可折叠的交互式终端。它由主机启动真实 shell 的 PTY 会话，并通过 WebSocket 将终端输入输出连接到浏览器面板。用户可用 xterm.js 查看终端内容、调整面板高度、重启或折叠会话，并在设置卡修改 shell、工作目录、主题、字号和透明度。适合需要在 DSH Web 中直接运行命令行程序的用户。主机需要 DSH 的 subprocess 与 webServer 服务；首次加载 xterm.js 需要访问 jsDelivr，离线时可使用纯文本回退界面。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:214-266","lib/index.js:269-363","lib/client.js:459-617","lib/client.js:215-328"]}
{"unit_id":"mervyn-teo__dsh-plugin-terminal#card-en","repo":"mervyn-teo/dsh-plugin-terminal","commit":"b542655664c236a7d28582d79c5a5f0e5258318c","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Terminal adds a collapsible shell panel to the DSH Web footer. A host PTY streams input and output to the browser. Users can resize sessions and change shell, directory, theme, and font. It needs DSH subprocess and webServer services. xterm.js loads from jsDelivr with a plain-text fallback.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:214-266","lib/index.js:269-363","lib/client.js:459-617","lib/client.js:215-328"]}
